            "typeName": "relatedDatasets",
            "multiple": true,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": [
              "FixCon trial dataset, containing all clinical, patient-reported and economic data.\nThe primary outcome was pneumonia within 30 days. Secondary outcomes included need for mechanical ventilation, level of thoracic pain, pulmonary function, hospital and intensive care unit length of stay, adverse events including fracture nonunion, mortality, and health-related quality of life (Euro-QoL-5D-5L and ShortForm-12). Economic data include costs for hospital care, extramural (in)direct health care use, and costs for work absence."
            ]
